[{"id":"cnm_h049_q1","topicId":"cnm_h049","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=x²−4 的正零点是多少？","answer":"2","explanation":"x²=4，零点是 −2 和 2，正的是 2。","verify":"max(roots2(1,0,-4))"},{"id":"cnm_h049_q2","topicId":"cnm_h049","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=x−5 的零点是多少？","answer":"5","explanation":"x−5=0，零点是 5。","verify":"5"},{"id":"cnm_h049_q3","topicId":"cnm_h049","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=x²−5x+6 的零点之和是多少？","answer":"5","explanation":"零点是 2 和 3，和为 5。","verify":"2+3"},{"id":"cnm_h049_q4","topicId":"cnm_h049","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"若 f(1)=−3，f(3)=5，且 f 的图象连续，则？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"一定没有零点"},{"key":"B","text":"在 (1，3) 内至少有一个零点"},{"key":"C","text":"零点只能是 1"},{"key":"D","text":"零点一定是 3"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"两端函数值异号，连续图象至少穿过一次 x 轴。","verify":"\"在 (1，3) 内至少有一个零点\""},{"id":"cnm_h050_q1","topicId":"cnm_h050","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"区间 (1，3) 的中点是多少？","answer":"2","explanation":"中点是 (1+3)/2=2。","verify":"(1+3)/2"},{"id":"cnm_h050_q2","topicId":"cnm_h050","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=x²−4。计算 f(2)。","answer":"0","explanation":"4−4=0，说明 2 就是零点，不必再分。","verify":"2**2-4"},{"id":"cnm_h050_q3","topicId":"cnm_h050","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"区间 (0，4) 做一次二分后，若零点在左半边，新区间右端点是多少？","answer":"2","explanation":"中点是 2，左半区间是 (0，2)，右端点是 2。","verify":"(0+4)/2"},{"id":"cnm_h050_q4","topicId":"cnm_h050","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"二分法每次把含根区间怎样处理？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"只保留长度较长的一半"},{"key":"B","text":"随机丢掉一个端点"},{"key":"C","text":"用中点分成两半，保留函数值异号的那一半"},{"key":"D","text":"同时保留两个半区间"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"中点函数值与哪个端点异号，零点就落在那一半。","verify":"\"用中点分成两半，保留函数值异号的那一半\""},{"id":"cnm_h051_q1","topicId":"cnm_h051","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"某种细菌每小时数量变为原来的 2 倍，开始有 100 个。3 小时后有多少个？","answer":"800","explanation":"指数模型 100×2³=800。","verify":"100*2**3"},{"id":"cnm_h051_q2","topicId":"cnm_h051","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"匀速行驶 s=40t。3 小时的路程是多少？","answer":"120","explanation":"一次模型，40×3=120。","verify":"40*3"},{"id":"cnm_h051_q3","topicId":"cnm_h051","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"正方形边长每增加 1，面积按平方增加。边长从 0 增到 6 时面积是多少？","answer":"36","explanation":"面积模型 s=x²，x=6 时面积 36。","verify":"6**2"},{"id":"cnm_h051_q4","topicId":"cnm_h051","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"数量每经过相同时间就乘同一个大于 1 的常数，更适合？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"一次函数模型"},{"key":"B","text":"反比例函数模型"},{"key":"C","text":"常数函数模型"},{"key":"D","text":"指数函数模型"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"成倍增长是指数变化，不是每次加同一个数。","verify":"\"指数函数模型\""},{"id":"cnm_h052_q1","topicId":"cnm_h052","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"按模型 P=20+3t，t=10 时的值是多少？","answer":"50","explanation":"20+30=50。","verify":"20+3*10"},{"id":"cnm_h052_q2","topicId":"cnm_h052","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"按模型 N=5·2^t，t=4 时的值是多少？","answer":"80","explanation":"5×16=80。","verify":"5*2**4"},{"id":"cnm_h052_q3","topicId":"cnm_h052","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"模型 y=100−8t 在 t=5 时的值是多少？","answer":"60","explanation":"100−40=60。","verify":"100-8*5"},{"id":"cnm_h052_q4","topicId":"cnm_h052","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"用函数模型预测之后，还应该？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"用新的实际数据检验模型是否合适"},{"key":"B","text":"把计算结果当成绝对事实"},{"key":"C","text":"改掉所有不符合的数据"},{"key":"D","text":"不再收集数据"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"模型是近似。预测要接受检验，不合适就修改模型。","verify":"\"用新的实际数据检验模型是否合适\""}]
